&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;34&quot;&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO INCLUSION AND ACCESSIBILITY&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;35&quot;&gt;At Decathlon, we recognize the immense value that diversity brings to our teams, and we continuously strive to foster and cultivate an inclusive and equitable workplace: this is why Inclusion is one of our Human Fundamentals. We encourage people of all backgrounds and abilities to apply, as we firmly believe that diversity of thought, culture, identity, and lived experience makes us stronger.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;36&quot;&gt;Decathlon is also committed to providing an inclusive and accessible recruitment process for all candidates. If you require any reasonable adjustments during the process, you can request them via the application form; your request will remain confidential and will not affect the outcome of your hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moniepoint Inc. is Africa’s all-in-one financial platform, helping 20 million businesses and individuals access seamless payments, banking, credit, cross-border, and business management tools each month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Nigeria’s largest merchant acquirer, we power most of the country’s point-of-sale (POS) transactions. Through our subsidiaries, Moniepoint Inc. processes over $250 billion in digital payment transaction value annually.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Moniepoint, as an Analytics Manager, you will use data to make better decisions, faster for the business. You will own metrics, measurement, experimentation and the analysis/data roadmap for a business area. You’ll use data to quantify business KPIs and conduct analyses to uncover unknowns, helping the business unit achieve its goals for acquisition, conversion, activation, retention, and revenue. As a leader of the business unit, the role sits at the intersection of product management, data engineering, and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Leadership: Build a disciplined, exceptional analytical team. Develop and execute a comprehensive data and analytics roadmap and strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Building &amp;amp; Management: Hire, develop, and retain a high-performing team of analytics professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Insights &amp;amp; Analytics - including forecast building, business analysis and model development and productionisation. Drive the generation of actionable insights from data to support various business functions, including product, operations, marketing and engineering. What is our actual CAC per channel? Which customer segments are more/less engaged? What are our customers’ share of wallet - how can we use this? What is the typical behaviour of a Moniepoint consumer? What products cause the biggest incremental engagement?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Collaboration: Partner with growth, product, and engineering managers to ensure we collect the right data for meaningful business insights. Bring data leadership and rigour to our approach to product development. Build a strategic understanding of the business and structure complex projects to bring them to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business: Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain the yearly forecast and budget for your products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the product&#39;s growth plan and lead execution across the entire funnel from acquisition through to monetisation and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and optimise specific business metrics or commercial goals, covering the entire funnel from new user acquisition through conversion, activation, retention, and expansion&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.productled.org/foundations/the-rise-of-the-growth-product-manager&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform detailed product analysis covering the product management funnel with all its aspects, implementing changes into the buying funnel to improve conversion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute A/B testing programs to optimise sales and conversion rates/adoption at each funnel stage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead testing and optimisation efforts for the conversion funnel across offline and online channels, prioritising tests that drive the biggest business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the product&#39;s design and deploy experiments to improve lifetime value (LTV) and decrease churn&lt;a href=&quot;https://medium.com/swlh/who-are-growth-product-managers-43626ffed444&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical: Data &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use deep, flexible, and comprehensive analytics covering the entire funnel from marketing acquisition to product usage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse user behaviour to improve the sales funnel and increase conversions, using advanced analytics to assess campaign performance and refine strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track growth metrics including customer acquisition cost (CAC), activation rate, retention rate, payback time, and revenue per customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct cohort analysis and journey mapping to identify bottlenecks and optimisation opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;+5 years in Analytics and Analytics Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years in a management role managing teams and driving strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in a consumer-FMCG environment, preferably in a CPG or fintech environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience scaling product businesses, with demonstrated ownership of significant revenue targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with ability to drive metrics and benchmarks, plus experience with growth experiments, A/B testing, and funnel optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep SQL knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in product analytics tools (Mixpanel, Grafana, Tableau, Looker, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of data analytics, user behaviour analysis and segmentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills to interact with teams, stakeholders, and users through verbal presentations, written reports, and visual media&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hotjar.com/growth-product-management/growth-product-manager/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build, mentor, and scale high-performing product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in data analytics tools and digital marketing platforms with the ability to manage and mentor teams of marketers, analysts, and designers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with strong commercial awareness and business acumen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Performance Indicators&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User acquisition and activation rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer retention and churn rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expansion revenue (upsell/cross-sell)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Lifetime Value (LTV) / Customer Acquisition Cost (CAC) ratio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product adoption metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced degree in Business or STEM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Growth Analytics, Product analytics, Credit risk analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in both mass-marketing and product-led growth models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing P&amp;amp;L or budget responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture - We put our people first and prioritise the well-being of every team member. We’ve built a company where all opinions carry weight and where all voices are heard. We value and respect each other and always look out for one another. Above all, we are human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning - We have a learning and development-focused environment with an emphasis on knowledge sharing, training, and regular internal technical talks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation - You’ll receive an attractive salary, pension, health insurance, annual bonus, plus other benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect in the hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Online SQL take-home task &lt;em&gt;(30 mins): &lt;/em&gt;Take-home test.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Case 1 &lt;em&gt;(1 hour - 1 hour 30 mins)&lt;/em&gt;: Live case. No take-home required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Case 2 &lt;em&gt;(1 hour - 1 hour 30 mins)&lt;/em&gt;: Live case. No take-home required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exec Interview &lt;em&gt;(30 mins - 1 hour)&lt;/em&gt;: Culture Fit. No take-home required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Your IMC journey begins with a three-week Global Trainee Program led by our seasoned engineers and traders, during which you’ll link up with graduates from all IMC regions: Europe, the United States, India and Asia-Pacific. During this traineeship, you’ll learn more about IMC, the basics of trading and options theory. Training continues back at your local office, where you’ll receive support from a dedicated mentor. As a Graduate Risk Analyst, you operate at the beating heart of our business: in the dealing room of IMC’s Amsterdam office. Your work supports IMC’s critical day-to-day risk management activities, including the monitoring and analysis of our markets, as well as our credit, liquidity, and operational risks. What happens next is up to you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR CORE RESPONSIBILTIES &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert in options, financial markets, and how IMC applies algorithmic trading as a market maker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the ongoing development of IMC’s proprietary risk management systems, together with our Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse developments in the markets in which we trade and identify risks and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an integral part of your team by advising on limit requests, monitoring intraday and overnight risks, and discussing key exposures with our trading desks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR SKILLS AND EXPERIENCES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recent or upcoming graduates seeking to join IMC full-time in February 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An academic background in Mathematics, Physics and/or Econometrics or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in a programming language is preferred (Python, MATLAB or R)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-class analytical skills and a desire to solve complicated problems creatively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine interest in financial markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: If you have already applied for this position during the current recruitment season and were not selected, you may reapply when the next recruitment season begins in Summer 2027. We encourage you to focus on enhancing your skillset before reapplying.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Due to current U.S. immigration and visa restrictions, some candidates may not be eligible to obtain the U.S. business visa required as part of our Global Traineeship Programme. As the programme includes mandatory training in the United States shortly after joining, we are unfortunately unable to proceed with applications from candidates who are unable to obtain the required visa within the programme timeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;If you are a dual passport holder of another nationality or a European citizen who wants to relocate back to Europe, you remain welcome to apply and should inform our campus recruitment team of your situation:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IMC is a research-driven trading firm where quantitative modeling, machine learning, and engineering shape how modern markets are traded. A stabilizing force in markets since 1989, we provide liquidity across trading venues, delivering the best outcome in value and risk management to investors. Using our own technology and capital, we build proprietary systems and algorithms that operate across global markets. Our researchers, traders, and engineers work as a collective, combining rapid experimentation, advanced infrastructure, and real-time feedback to turn insight into execution and execution into advantage.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zone &amp;amp; Company Software Consulting LLC (“Zone”) is the ERP-native AI platform for financial operations, purpose-built for organizations running on Oracle NetSuite. We are redefining how finance teams operate by delivering an AI-powered system that automates, connects, and scales financial workflows directly within the ERP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the AI operating system for finance teams in NetSuite, Zone enables more than 4,500 customers worldwide to run smarter, faster, and with greater accuracy. Our platform spans the full financial lifecycle, including Quote-to-Cash, Procure-to-Pay, Treasury, Payroll Management, and Record-to-Report, eliminating manual processes and unlocking real-time financial intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By embedding intelligence directly into NetSuite, Zone helps finance teams move beyond reactive work to proactive, strategic impact. Learn more at&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.zoneandco.com&quot;&gt; www.zoneandco.com&lt;/a&gt; or follow us on LinkedIn:&lt;a href=&quot;http://linkedin.com/company/zoneandco&quot;&gt; linkedin.com/company/zoneandco&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x12ofw9d&quot;&gt;Zone &amp;amp; Co. is looking for a high-velocity Account Executive to sell finance automation solutions to the Office of the CFO. We move fast, set ambitious goals, and expect our team to deliver. Our targets are designed to be achievable, and we&#39;re looking for disciplined, driven sellers who know how to manage a pipeline, maintain deal momentum, and consistently convert opportunities into closed business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x12ofw9d&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll own pipeline generation through strategic outbound prospecting, complemented by additional opportunities from our partner ecosystem and marketing team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x12ofw9d&quot;&gt;If you thrive in a fast-paced sales environment, are comfortable navigating short sales cycles, bring rigor to your MEDDPICC process, and enjoy building relationships face-to-face with partners and customers, this could be the opportunity for you. You&#39;ll also have the chance to develop deep expertise across a broad and growing product portfolio in a dynamic, expanding market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own a net new number. &lt;/strong&gt;Win new logos across a defined EMEA territory against an annual ARR target, measured monthly and quarterly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build your own pipeline. &lt;/strong&gt;Outbound is part of the job, every week: calls, sequences, LinkedIn, and your own network. Partner and marketing leads are a bonus, not the plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get out there. &lt;/strong&gt;Travel to partner offices, industry events, and customer meetings. Face time with partners and clients is key.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work the partner ecosystem. &lt;/strong&gt;Build trusted relationships with our implementation and referral partners so they bring you in early and back you to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run a high-velocity motion. &lt;/strong&gt;Manage 30 + active opportunities at once and close 10–15 deals a month, from first call through pricing, paper process and signature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell with discipline. &lt;/strong&gt;Use MEDDPICC on every deal: find the pain, the metrics and the economic buyer, build a champion, and run a clear close plan with a next step every time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell the whole journey.&lt;/strong&gt; We are positioning the complete end-to-end story. We want to connect the customer pain with how to solve finance challenges, and turn that vision into bigger, multi-product wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Solution Consulting. &lt;/strong&gt;Bring in SCs at the right moment for sharp, tailored demos on larger deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast accurately. &lt;/strong&gt;Keep Salesforce clean and call your number with confidence every week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You consistently hit, and regularly beat, your monthly and quarterly ARR targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your pipeline is a good mix of self-sourced and partner-sourced from relationships you&#39;ve built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners know you by name and bring you into their deals early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your deals are MEDDPICC-complete, your forecast is reliable, and your average deal size grows as you sell more of the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years closing net new SaaS business, with a track record of hitting and overachieving ARR targets in a fast-paced, transactional or mid-market motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A real outbound habit: you prospect daily and you&#39;re proud of the pipeline you create yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong MEDDPICC (or MEDDIC) skills, applied for real, not just known.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial acumen: you understand ROI, pricing and negotiation, and you&#39;re comfortable talking value with finance leaders and CFOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to the Office of the CFO AP Automation, Procure-to-Pay, billing, payments or order-to-cash, is a big plus. NetSuite ecosystem experience is a bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diligent, organised approach: you manage a busy pipeline without dropping the detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A keen eye to learn. Our product set grows through innovation and acquisition, and you&#39;ll want to master new products fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Happy on the road: comfortable travelling to partner sites, events and client meetings across the UK and EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident with Salesforce, Gong and modern sales tools. As well as AI tools such as Clay and Claude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zone, we provide the platform; you provide the grit. We operate as a high-velocity, fully remote, global team where autonomy isn&#39;t just a perk, it’s the standard. We’re looking for self-driven professionals eager to navigate the complexities of a unique SaaS environment and take full command of their professional evolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We ditch micro-management for high-trust flexibility, ensuring you have the space to innovate and scale. Our benefits are built to fuel this lifestyle, supporting your life beyond the screen so you can focus on making a global impact. Explore our offerings at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zoneandco.com/careers&quot;&gt;https://www.zoneandco.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Our Global Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone &amp;amp; Co is an Equal Opportunity Employer committed to building a diverse, equitable, and inclusive workplace. We thrive on unique perspectives and strongly encourage candidates of all backgrounds to apply. Here, your identity is valued, and your talent is the only limit to your growth. All qualified applicants will receive consideration regardless of race, color, religion, sex, orientation, age, disability, or any other protected factor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Terms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;United States&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employment with Zone is &lt;strong&gt;“At-Will”&lt;/strong&gt;, meaning either party may terminate the relationship at any time, with or without cause or notice, in accordance with applicable law. This job description does not constitute an employment contract or guarantee of continued employment. Duties and responsibilities may evolve as the company grows and may change at any time with or without notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-US Jurisdictions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is offered as a Fixed-Term or Permanent Contract based on your country of residence.&amp;nbsp; Employment is subject to a written contract which outlines specific notice periods, probationary terms, and statutory entitlements.&lt;/p&gt;
